      "specialNote": "Use only inside a!formLayout(titleBar) or a!wizardLayout(titleBar). Image is hidden on smaller screens (responsive). Compatible with Portals and Offline Mobile.",
      "documentationUrl": "https://docs.appian.com/suite/help/latest/Header_Template_Image.html"
    }
  }
